# Krezk's townsfolk inside the wall (lane 4, F2): Stefan the woodcutter walking firewood from the pile to the houses.
# He walks his route (the location's `path`) and stops when someone comes up to him.

~ woodcutter
if flag.ilya_fate == "healed"
Stefan the Woodcutter [smile]: Ilya's up and about. Took a cord of wood off me this morning to prove it. You did that, I hear. Thank you.
-> END
endif
Stefan the Woodcutter: The Burgomaster let you in, so I'll say good day. Wood for the winter. It's always winter for the wood.
-> END

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Lane 28 (2026-10-08): Krezk at work inside its wall:
# the well, the pens, the shrine, the gate and the south row. Lines unvoiced.

~ well_wife
Goodwife Rodica: One bucket for the Burgomaster, one for the widow at the end of the row, one for me, and a prayer for each. The well's never frozen. Not once. We don't ask why, we just say thank you.
-> END

~ bucket_wife
Goodwife Sanda: Water to the south row, a word at the shrine, and back. Thirty times a day. My arms are as strong as Cezar's and my knees are holier than the abbot's.
-> END

~ gate_boy
if flag.ilya_fate == "healed"
Dumitru [smile]: Ilya's out of the house! Everybody says it was you. Is it true you've been past Vallaki? Is it true there's a lake?
-> END
endif
Dumitru: Nobody comes up the road. Except you. Did you see wolves? Did you see the castle? Is it true it has a thousand windows?
-> END

~ goatherd
Stelian: That one's Rodica's, and that one's the Burgomaster's, and the one with the horn is nobody's, because nobody's brave enough. Mind your fingers by the rails.
if not quest.one_horned_billy
set billy_rumor
quest one_horned_billy rumored
Stelian: Turned up last spring, already grown, with a woman's ring jammed down on his horn. Nobody's been brave enough to take it off him. He looks at you like he's waiting for something.
elif flag.dragos_freed
Stelian: My best billy turned into a ferryman. I've lost a goat and gained a man who's very good with goats. I'm calling it even.
endif
-> END

~ fence_mender
Cezar: The billy breaks a rail, I mend a rail. He breaks another. I think he likes the company.
-> END

~ carver
if flag.mother_flown
Old Pavel: A sun a day, still. And on Sundays my niece comes down off the mountain and lands on my roof. I've had it mended twice. I'd have it mended every week.
elif flag.clovin_family_found
Old Pavel: A sun a day, still. But on Sundays I go up the mountain with soup, so on Saturdays I carve two.
else
Old Pavel: A sun for the shrine. One every day. When the shrine is full, I start on the windows. Somebody has to keep asking for the morning.
endif
* [if quest.lighter_than_it_should_be and not flag.sorin_known] The toys on the Krezkov graves. Are they yours? -> krezk/lighter_than_it_should_be:pavel
* Good day. -> END

~ wall_watch
Watchman Lazar: The gate's watched, the wall's watched, and the road is watched most of all. Walk where you like inside. Just walk where I can see you.
-> END

~ goat
Narrator: The goat chews something that was probably part of the fence, and watches you with its strange square eyes until you go away.
* [if spell:speak_with_animals] Ask the goat what's been happening in the pens. -> goat_speaks
* [if not spell:speak_with_animals] [knows:speak_with_animals] (Cast Speak with Animals, and ask the goat what's been happening in the pens.) -> goat_cast
* [if spell:speak_with_animals or knows:speak_with_animals] Leave it to the fence. -> END
-> END

~ goat_cast
cast speak_with_animals
if check.last
-> goat_speaks
endif
-> END

# Speak with Animals (2024 PHB): the pens know who sleeps in them (The One-Horned Billy, The Pack's Runt).
~ goat_speaks
Narrator: The goat answers with its mouth full. Krezk's goats, it turns out, are as blunt as Krezk's people.
if not flag.dragos_freed
Narrator: "The one-horned billy isn't a goat. He talks people-words in his sleep, and cries."
if not quest.one_horned_billy
set billy_rumor
quest one_horned_billy rumored
endif
endif
if flag.den_children_freed and quest.the_packs_runt != done and quest.the_packs_runt != given
Narrator: "The small boy who sleeps in our pen smells of wolf. More every night. He doesn't eat us. He shakes. Something big comes to the bottom of the wall in the dark and calls him by a name that isn't his."
if not quest.the_packs_runt
quest the_packs_runt rumored
endif
endif
Narrator: "Under the stones by the track there's a ring that's warm in the mouth. Good in winter. We take turns."
reveal track_cairn_ring
-> END

~ billy
-> krezk/one_horned_billy:billy
